  'A hundred and twenty li southeast is Mount Dongting, with gold above, silver and iron below, zha, li, ju and you trees, and jian, miwu, shaoyao and xiongqiong herbs. Two daughters of the Di dwell here and frequent the Jiang pool; Li-Yuan winds connect with the Xiaoxiang pool among the Nine Jiang, with whirling wind and torrential rain. Strange gods resemble people, carrying snakes and holding snakes in both hands; strange birds also occur.',
