  '东二百三十里榮余，上铜下银、多柳芑，虫列怪蛇怪虫。594在67页末、595续68页；两项无独立完整形貌留占位，不画混合怪兽。',
  'Two hundred and thirty li east is Mount Rongyu, with copper above, silver below, liu and qi trees, and strange snakes and strange chong.',
